# Scouts at a foreign (Dutch, at peace) colony: @SCOUTCOLONY (FUN_5f7a_000e). Fixture (map_found_colony start, France
# spring 1599, gold 429): the five French go-to units sentried; Seasoned Scouts #77 and #95 (unit index 76, 94) moved
# beside Fort Orange (38,40) to (39,39) and (37,39), full moves, no orders, stale goto cleared; #77 active, cursor on it.
key KP_1                   # #77 bumps Fort Orange: @SCOUTCOLONY Meet With Mayor / Infiltrate / Attack / Nothing
key Up
key Return                 # row 3 "Nothing": the scouts stay put, whole allotment spent; colonist #88 is next
