key KP_3                   # #95 bumps Fort Orange: @SCOUTCOLONY again
key Return                 # row 0 "Meet With Mayor": forced FUN_5bfb_153e audience, "We note with displeasure"
# The audience reads the census rows (raw 97439-97492): France's 0x95b2 field strength on continent 1 is 8,
# the Dutch row 64, so 153e scores the French worthy of war and the Dutch declare it.
key Return                 # dismiss: "We can no longer tolerate your foul provocations. Prepare for WAR!"
key Return                 # dismiss: talk over, Caravel #126 in Quebec is next
